WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.617
Long and wide forms serve different downstream needs.

00:00:03.617 --> 00:00:11.382
Long form is usually more flexible for charts, modeling, filtering, and changing categories.

00:00:11.382 --> 00:00:17.632
Wide form is often convenient for fixed business reports and side by side comparisons.

00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:24.752
A good pipeline can keep a stable long analytical table and create wide presentation outputs only where they are

00:00:24.752 --> 00:00:26.614
actually needed.
